WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,450
The temperature dropped wider than expected

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:10,860
There's something wrong with the weather

3
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:11,860
at this speed

4
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:12,860
It won't take two days

5
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:15,860
The entire sea will be frozen by the wind

6
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:16,860
after ice

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,860
Able to defend against food

8
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:19,860
Everything is indispensable

9
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,900
Relying on salvaging scattered materials is not a long-term solution

10
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,900
You have to build your own self-sufficient system and

11
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,900
I have to mass-produce intelligent robots like Zero

12
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,900
Go farm and serve as a guard

13
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,900
Build an absolutely self-sufficient maritime fortress

14
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,930
And all this

15
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:34,930
All require a large amount of evolution points

16
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:48,410
ready to work
